SUMMARY:Sea Friends Fest
DESCRIPTION:SEA FRIENDS FEST is an inaugural festival that celebrates Southeast Asian arts and culture through an artisan market\, food\, live music\, games\, and a film screening. This celebration is open to the public and welcomes all ages and cultures. The SEA FRIEND FEST Artisan Market will run indoors/outdoors (weather dependent) from 11am-4pm. There will be an indoor Film Screening that runs from 6-8pm to close off the day.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/sea-friends-fest/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/13120332/SEAFRIENDSPOSTER-768x960-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
