SUMMARY:Mark Battenberg Music presents Mystic Music for a Midsummer Night
DESCRIPTION:Please join Guitarist Mark Battenberg and Shakuhachi flute Master Debbie Danbrook for a mystical evening of original eclectic music and poetry\, to celebrate the beautiful season of summer. Admission is $20 or pay what you can.
